      "text": "Depth (m)     c (m/s)\n              1480    1500    1520    1540\n     0        ├─────────────────●         ← warm surface layer (~1530)\n  100 │       │               ●           thermocline: temp drops fast\n  200 │       │           ●\n  300 │       │       ●\n  500 │       │     ●                     minimum sound speed (~1480 m/s)\n 1000 │       │      ●                    ← SOFAR axis\n 2000 │       │         ●\n 3000 │       │             ●\n 4000 │       │                 ●         ← pressure dominates (c increases)\n 5000 │       │                     ●"
    },
